IMPORT `pb-core`
IMPORT `pb1-art-11-i-ii-vi-empregado-domestico-avulso`

-- pb1-tests-art-11-i-ii-vi.l4: tests of art. 11, incisos I, II and VI and §§ 2 to 5. Every expected value is
-- worked out by hand from the text (src:101-114, 140, 150-153) and written beside the assertion.
-- The fixtures are generated: each is one list of 22 TRUE/FALSE values in the order of the record, written
-- out by a script from a table of which facts are true; the expected answers below are the author's.

§ `Testes do art. 11, incisos I, II e VI`

